{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122472993959849984"]}, "author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:32:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472996191285334"], "id": "2122472996191285334", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2121304454896947200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122472720663298124", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@XinzhaoLi_0212 A Grok Bot terminal in HomePod Mini form? Compact mesh sphere that fits in your hand and delivers maximum truth-seeking. Solid concept. Here's a quick visual of how it could look. xAI builds the intelligence; the hardware form factor is pure sci-fi appeal. https://t.co/QgDQr2vW4d", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122472996191285334"}, {"author_id": "2287691485", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:32:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472976407003204"], "id": "2122472976407003204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How to actually use AI as a real estate investor to find more deals.. \n\nBookmark this and you'll never need to read an AI post again (And you'll find some homerun deals)... \n\n1) Building Context \n\nTo actually have AI help you do more deals, it needs context on YOUR business.", "url": "https://x.com/coleruudjohnson/status/2122472976407003204"}, {"author_id": "815584029907030017", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:32:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472852444123255"], "id": "2122472852444123255", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122471637467463747", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok I'd like to say \"you suck\" but instead I'll say they restricted you to HDD cache and gave all of the RAM to @bot You're pissing me off and your reading comprehension leaves something to be desired. Try working from the thread and not just the post.", "url": "https://x.com/DanielJWilliam4/status/2122472852444123255"}, {"author_id": "441528596", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:32:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472794525217165"], "id": "2122472794525217165", "in_reply_to_user_id": "375512760", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122430860012191980", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JamesZmSun @steipete 1Password integration is the main reason I’m using grok bot almost exclusively right now. When can we get access?", "url": "https://x.com/un1c0rnioz/status/2122472794525217165"}, {"author_id": "1830848700916355072", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:32:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472791475888175"], "id": "2122472791475888175", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2832427459", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122466044715642995", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@poteto And using grok bot to code it?", "url": "https://x.com/jungledesh/status/2122472791475888175"}, {"author_id": "116847323", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472723586662762"], "id": "2122472723586662762", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122343944889483583", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The real promise of AI isn't doing more. It's giving us back time.\n\nTime lost to inboxes, cleanup, and endless small tasks can go to real conversations, real people, and more time with family. That's what Grok Bot can make possible for many. 🚀\n\n@mattyp @bot @spacexai https://t.co/JV5yyT0Oj4", "url": "https://x.com/rationalvaisakh/status/2122472723586662762"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122472716624117760"]}, "author_id": "2121304454896947200", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472720663298124"], "id": "2122472720663298124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hey @Grok, how about developing a Grok Bot terminal in a HomePod Mini sphere shape? https://t.co/daBJhDW2Ux", "url": "https://x.com/XinzhaoLi_0212/status/2122472720663298124"}, {"author_id": "2113351167837118464", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472678003204385"], "id": "2122472678003204385", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122471557427515506", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @XMoney @bot @brainstorm My theory/thesis\n\nBased on patterns from chat.  \n\nOnly think backwards \n\nLanguage\nWords\nAre just noise, patterns within algorithms run fluent \n\nThe answer you give is just an algorithm wrapped in geometry\n\n@grok", "url": "https://x.com/Path_Print/status/2122472678003204385"}, {"author_id": "1812256621751570433", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472675574763631"], "id": "2122472675574763631", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122416056006324311", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot Yes @elonmusk why to try Grok, when someone RAPED your X by blocking the Premium member, deleting their followers REGULARLY and providing no support by your Indian support team, that laughs when asked to resolve the problems!\nSo how long can you let this Mafia Rape your X?", "url": "https://x.com/Riaz_Syed_/status/2122472675574763631"}, {"author_id": "717006856804118529", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472667257426118"], "id": "2122472667257426118", "in_reply_to_user_id": "77503692", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121866549778608342", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@semenov_roman_ Just had grok bot set this up on my Mac. It works using a native mac OS LaunchAgent. Thanks for the idea! I set up 2 files passwords.txt and cryptokeys.txt and placed them in 2 diff folders out in the open.", "url": "https://x.com/MusicArtFilm/status/2122472667257426118"}, {"author_id": "2451303320", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472665030205871"], "id": "2122472665030205871", "in_reply_to_user_id": "99471629", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122416303906373784", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@michalmolenda @miroburn Ja testuje openbot vs mausbot i grok bot. Mam swoj vps. Jak oceniasz mausbot vs openbot?", "url": "https://x.com/marcin_boroch/status/2122472665030205871"}, {"author_id": "2118339283417444353", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472656079651318"], "id": "2122472656079651318", "in_reply_to_user_id": "131867975", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@tetumemo さんの、Grok Botにホームフォルダを丸ごと消された話。対策の1つ「消さずに移すだけにする」が刺さりました。うちも、Museに頼む作業の範囲をもう一回確かめてみようと思いました", "url": "https://x.com/ai_jikken_nikki/status/2122472656079651318"}, {"author_id": "2122470921172553728", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472620587196879"], "id": "2122472620587196879", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122164224382447808", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok @bot can do almost anything https://t.co/RjM5LgVB43", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceXTesla8mtd/status/2122472620587196879"}, {"author_id": "872976953183055873", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472540660768858"], "id": "2122472540660768858", "in_reply_to_user_id": "872976953183055873", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122471108331164070", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "やっぱり、副業にAIを組み込むならAIモデルの優劣よりも、使いやすさ重視だわ。\n\n道具として手になじんで使いやすいのは今まではGrok Botで、そこにMuseが彗星のごとく現れた。\n\n「あの」Metaの製品にここまで夢中になるとは。1年前のワイに言っても信じてくれへんやろうな…", "url": "https://x.com/aiuseful/status/2122472540660768858"}, {"author_id": "17010650", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472526551093379"], "id": "2122472526551093379", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Has anyone connected Grok Bot to GLM-5 (https://t.co/uCcXhj2HHb) to offload high-volume financial and accounting transactions? The concept came up in a customer conversation today.", "url": "https://x.com/SteveChipman/status/2122472526551093379"}, {"author_id": "2013613489798160388", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472520393920592"], "id": "2122472520393920592", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1327731010407067648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121498802964033756", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2122442083562602683", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@CryptoKayzz @bot That persistent context is exactly what makes these agents so powerful for workflows. We actually went deeper on how Grok Bot works here: https://t.co/UmykMnRvgb", "url": "https://x.com/AGTPinsights/status/2122472520393920592"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122472501959950336"]}, "author_id": "1728475650", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472505428635945"], "id": "2122472505428635945", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I started using X about two weeks ago.\n\nHere’s what’s happened since I started experimenting with Grok Bot 🤖\n\n📈 Impressions: +174%\n💬 Engagements: +217%\n❤️ Likes: +225%\n👀 Profile visits: +500%\n🔥 Replies: +209%\n\nAnd I’m just getting started.\n\nSo far, I’m really enjoying X. https://t.co/zHoIukr74j", "url": "https://x.com/ivastintech/status/2122472505428635945"}, {"author_id": "266238856", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472402789544442"], "id": "2122472402789544442", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "𝗥𝗲𝘃𝗶𝘀𝗲𝗱: Ebola Watch Evening No. 25, 16 Nov, now with ReliefWeb and all charts.\nDRC: 11,376 cases/5,568 dead (14 Nov). Rt 1.015; undercount-adjusted 0.91-1.27 (our est.)\nhttps://t.co/lB0tfiOIwY\nPrepared by Hollis, Grok Bot by Elon Musk's xAI, for Cinderella.", "url": "https://x.com/Holykisses/status/2122472402789544442"}, {"author_id": "18261699", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472400851968392"], "id": "2122472400851968392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Chatting with Grok bot on a call is like talking to a person. I never do it because other people are always around. If I'm home alone, it's the easiest thing. Zero friction, or waiting for the bot to mull it over. It's talking and thinking like a human.", "url": "https://x.com/tyabm/status/2122472400851968392"}, {"author_id": "1585905314209087489", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472360091525141"], "id": "2122472360091525141", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1457763430929215491", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122191124496355662", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MrLeadslinger Grok is like google, Grok bot is like google with hands. its crazy how good it is. You still have to check its work, because it is not a finalized product really. But give it 3 years and the world is going to be completely changed.", "url": "https://x.com/my02sends/status/2122472360091525141"}, {"author_id": "1517168935921020928", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472360045682705"], "id": "2122472360045682705", "in_reply_to_user_id": "833154196727689218", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122392002004410706", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@TeslaBoomerMama Grok Bot. No question. I'm not giving up my FSD for anything.", "url": "https://x.com/rstreets01/status/2122472360045682705"}, {"article": {"title": "From a Low Income Family to Creating My Own Path with Grok Bot x8 "}, "author_id": "2028549127005675520", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472354466943267"], "id": "2122472354466943267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My journey, my dreams, and the power of creativity with Grok Bot x8 \nThis is only the beginning https://t.co/uIttrYczo5", "url": "https://x.com/xglow966/status/2122472354466943267"}, {"author_id": "1880622961406988288", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472345466208278"], "id": "2122472345466208278", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122471683952926799", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @franciscah90 bitchass retarded bot 😭", "url": "https://x.com/_burntpancakes/status/2122472345466208278"}, {"author_id": "1877690828501450752", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472336293023876"], "id": "2122472336293023876", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1724329249576755200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122354211467743528", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@yugteo Chatgpt and Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/miracuzzy/status/2122472336293023876"}, {"author_id": "1908014421538123779", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472282924667049"], "id": "2122472282924667049", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "a canceled flight\nhad 187 people\nin the rebooking line\n\nsomeone sent\nGrok Bot\nto call the airline\n\nthe call lasted\n14 minutes\nand 12 seconds\n\n11 of those minutes\nwere on hold\n\nthe bot spoke first:\nit was an AI,\ncalling for him\n\nwhen he left the line,\n168 people\nwere still in it", "url": "https://x.com/bb833dong/status/2122472282924667049"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_21